s off pitch  get in the air to right field fairly  deep slicing towards the corner frazier  over it might go  and it's gone a home run todd frazier  tucked that one about 10 feet to the  left of the foul pole  in the right field corner for frazier  his third home run of the year  and the mints are on the board the  yankees lead is cut to 4-1  infield back yankees with a three-run  lead alonso trying to get that runner in  from third with one out  [Applause]  and he chases the pitch out of the zone  and gets the strikeout  as alonso he's a runner at third base  with one out now it's two outs two outs  runner on third  mariznick drives one deep left field  back goes garner it's over his head and  off the base of the wall  frazier is in and marissa pulls into  second base with an rbi  double a bolt off the bat of jake  perisic to get the mets closer it's now  four to two  two outs mariznick at second rosario's  the batter it's a four to two yankee  lead it's the fourth inning  rosario hits it hard right side past  lemay you into right field  mariznick rounds third he'll score  easily and another two out rbi for the  mets  here in the fourth inning ahmed rosario  makes it a one-run  game as the yankees lead has been cut to  four to three  runner at second rosario runner at first  torino's  jeff mcneil has hit the ball hard twice  today neal lines one into center field  for a base hit and that'll tie up the  game  rosario scores torino's to third jeff  mcneal with an rbi  single and the mitts have come from four  runs down to draw even  it's four to four in the fourth  [Applause]  beautiful play by archello off balance  throw when he gets frazier  he took an extra base hit away from it's  not only catching this ball is to throw  against your body to put the perfect arc  on this throw and just a perfect  strike to ford what a tremendous play he  got the ground ball his momentum took  him away in foul territory  and he still threw on carport is on and  the yankees have two on and two out  for geo urchella big spot here on the  seven tie game castro deals  hit sharply and through for base hit  hicks rounds third he's coming home  here's the throw and he is safe moving  to third  is ford he's in there a big big hit for  urchella  as the yankees take a 5-4 lead so first  and third and here is gardner the 2-1  and it's a fair ball down the  right-field lineup kicks off the gate  scoring his fourth or shella will stop  at third it's an rbi double for gardner  and the yankees lead 6-4 but he has a  361 on base percentage which is the 18th  highest  and there's a base hit through the left  side that'll score lemay who voigt stops  at second a big rbi single  for aaron hicks and it's seven four  yankees so the tying runs are aboard  here  and ahmed rosario is going to be the  battery here  rosario toward the right side hole  estrada can't get it base hit  in the score comes frazier smith will  score as well  maurizio to third it's 7-6  ahmed rosario with his third hit of the  day drives in a pair  geraldis chapman taking the mound while  appealing his three-game suspension that  was imposed after his  dust up with the tampa bay rays the  other night  so now basically tied for the mets a  one-strike count to davis  takes off for third swinging to miss  throw to third  oh they got him what was hamilton  thinking going to third there  and higashiyoka got him with a perfect  throw  jd hits it out to center field hicks  giving ground to the warning  davis comes the game dave is dead  central against all this jump after the  mets get even  it's 7-7 in the night so smith is the  free runner at second  alonzo the batter 7-7 bottom of the 10th  that's driven deep down the left-field  line toward the stage  [Applause]  in the bottom of the tent and the mets  yank it out  9-7 and he ends a long day of baseball  with a very satisfying win  on a day that we honor the memory of top  seaver

